name: sim.unpackTable
description: Unpacks a buffer into a table
luaSynopsis: list/dict aTable = sim.unpackTable(bytes buffer, int packingScheme = 0)
pythonSynopsis: any[]/map aTable = sim.unpackTable(buffer buffer, int packingScheme = 0)
inputs:
1. buffer: an input buffer
2. packingScheme: 0 for CoppeliaSim format, 1 for CBOR format
outputs:
1. aTable: the unpacked buffer
replacedBy:
- name: unpack, class: app, file: app_unpack.method
